"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\" font-size=\"14\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"currentColor\">x</text><text x=\"84\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\" font-size=\"14\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"currentColor\">y</text></svg>",
